2026-10-03T04:02:33.5421300Z Description-en: easy-to-use, scalable distributed version control system
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5421797Z  Mercurial is a fast, lightweight Source Control Management system designed
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5422287Z  for efficient handling of very large distributed projects.
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5422616Z  .
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5422805Z  Its features include:
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5423090Z  * O(1) delta-compressed file storage and retrieval scheme
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5423545Z  * Complete cross-indexing of files and changesets for efficient exploration
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5424114Z  of project history
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5424441Z  * Robust SHA1-based integrity checking and append-only storage model
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5424907Z  * Decentralized development model with arbitrary merging between trees
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5425316Z  * High-speed HTTP-based network merge protocol
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5425627Z  * Easy-to-use command-line interface
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5425919Z  * Integrated stand-alone web interface
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5426189Z  * Small Python codebase
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5426413Z  .
2026-10-03T04:02:33.5426671Z  This package contains the architecture dependent files.
